{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o056b","title":"贾诩劝李傕郭汜张济率军西攻长安","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o056b-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"贾诩劝李傕郭汜张济率军西攻长安","evidence":["xunyu-e-o056b-q"]},{"id":"xunyu-a-p047-judgment","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之认为贾诩片言使乱源重起，严责其祸国。","evidence":["xunyu-q-p047-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0182","role":"献策","evidence":["xunyu-e-o056b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0089","role":"进攻","evidence":["xunyu-e-o056b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0090","role":"议军","evidence":["xunyu-e-o056b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0130","role":"议军","evidence":["xunyu-e-o056b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"董卓入洛阳至李傕入长安后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-o056b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o056b-q","source_order":[10,277,"O056b"],"order":2509}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0089","name":"李傕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0090","name":"郭汜","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0130","name":"张济","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0182","name":"贾诩","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o056b-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-5d90dcb2f24cf49d47b3","layer":"original","quote":"卓败，辅又死，众恐惧；校尉李傕、郭汜、张济等欲解散，间行归乡里。诩曰：“闻长安中议，欲尽诛凉州人。而诸君弃众单行，即一亭长能束君矣〖3〗。不如率众而西，所在收兵〖4〗；以攻长安，为董公报仇；幸而事济，奉国家以征天下〖5〗；若不济，走未后也〖6〗。”众以为然。傕乃西攻长安。语在《卓传》。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":276,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":46,"end":189},{"id":"xunyu-q-p047-judgment","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-5f44051c7b4ec0323527","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：《传》称“仁人之言，其利溥哉！”然则不仁之言，理必反是。夫仁功难著，而乱源易成；是故有祸机一发，而殃流百世者矣。当是时，元恶既枭，天地始开；致使厉阶重结，大梗殷流；邦国遘殄悴之哀，黎民婴周余之酷：岂不由贾诩片言乎？诩之罪也，一何大哉！自古兆乱，未有如此之甚！","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-484a810d8335b53bd925","start":0,"end":138}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
